    "description": "Sésamo is the second Brazilian version based on the famous North American series Sesame Street (1969–). This time, the series does not feature Garibaldo (Big Bird), the large yellow bird. However, we are reunited with the beloved characters Grover (André Milano), Come-Come (Cookie Monster, played by Paulo Henrique Santos), Bel (Thais Carvalho), Elmo (Kelly Guidotti), and Abby (Marilice Cosenza). As in the previous version, the show presents the puppets in their fun adventures, teaching the audience about various subjects in a creative way and following the daily life in the bustling village",
